SUMMARY:Family Time: with Special Guest Ms. Deidra from Nutley Public Library!
DESCRIPTION:Nutley Public Library is temporarily closed\, so we’ve 
 invited their Librarian Ms. Deidra to join us and share nursery rhymes 
 during Familytime Storytime (Session 1)!\n\nBooks\, songs\, rhymes and play 
 are the perfect way to inspire a love of literacy and learning in your 
 little ones.This interactive storytime is perfect for babies\, toddlers and 
 pre-K children. No registration required\; space is limited.
