DESCRIPTION:Stop by for free coffee\, hot cocoa\, snacks\, and relaxing 
 activities like coloring\, word searches\, and drawing in a warm\, 
 welcoming environment. \n\nThe MPL social worker and social work intern 
 host this initiative\, with coffee and snacks provided by the generosity of 
 Toni's Kitchen.
