DESCRIPTION:“Don’t Touch My Hair” is an event meant to create space for co
 nversations about natural hair\, especially for Black women. The goal is 
 to talk about embracing our hair\, the struggles many of us face\, and ho
 w we’ve had to advocate for our hair in school\, work\, and everyday spac
 es.\n“Help a Sista Out” focuses more on accessibility & empowerment throu
 gh service by providing things like haircuts\, manicures\, lash services\
 , and other self-care resources for women.\n\nHosted by: National Associa
 tion for the Advancement of Colored People\, Panther Progress\n\nAddition
 al Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/e
 vent/12425066
