X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairlocal": "https://montclairlocal.news/event/sons-at-luna-stage/2026-04-23/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:montclairlocal
X-SOURCE:Montclair Local News
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T193000
DTSTAMP:20260423T003530
CREATED:20260408T182337Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T182337Z
UID:10139483-1776972600-1776972600@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:& Sons at Luna Stage
DESCRIPTION:Winner of the Kirk Prize for Best New Play\, & Sons by Jack Angelo Cummings is a sharply funny\, quietly devastating portrait of brotherhood\, labor\, and the ways men learn—often badly—to love one another. \nOn a New Jersey construction site\, the DiSanti crew eats subs\, burritos\, and pizza on their lunch break while everything underneath begins to crack. Dom\, the sweet-natured\, perpetually high second son\, is caught between his best friend Juan\, a driven protégé hungry to lead the company\, and his older brother Anthony\, a imposing\, tightly woundvfigure newly returned after years of unexplained absence. As power struggles escalate and old wounds resurface\, the men avoid saying what they feel—touching\, jostling\, and posturing instead\, using work and food as cover for grief\, loyalty\, and longing. By turns hilarious and aching\, & Sons is an intimate meditation on masculinity\, inheritance\, and how blue-collar men translate emotion into action when language fails. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/sons-at-luna-stage/2026-04-23/
LOCATION:Luna Stage Theatre Company\, 555 Valley Road\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Sons.jpg
GEO:40.7691725;-74.2464479
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Luna Stage Theatre Company 555 Valley Road West Orange NJ 07052 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=555 Valley Road:geo:-74.2464479,40.7691725
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairlocal": "https://montclairlocal.news/event/bound-unbound-a-queer-quest-for-big-love-26/2026-04-23/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:montclairlocal
X-SOURCE:Montclair Local News
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T213000
DTSTAMP:20260423T003530
CREATED:20260401T180402Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260401T180402Z
UID:10139456-1776972600-1776979800@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:Bound/ Unbound: A Queer Quest for Big Love '26
DESCRIPTION:Bound/Unbound is a reimagined riff on Charles L. Mee’s BIG LOVE\, exploring the complexities of love\, dysfunctional relationships\, and the ferocity forged by heartache through a non-binary lens. Originally produced in 2000 as a modern adaptation of THE SUPPLIANTS by Aeschylus\, the story of fifty brides who flee to Italy to escape marrying their cousins is expanded in this devised piece to invite queer stories & relationships\, and non-binary gender identity & expression. How do we look at the “politics of love and gender” in a more expansive and nuanced way? How does this challenge preconceived notions of love\, commitment\, and the freedom to choose who and how we love? \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/bound-unbound-a-queer-quest-for-big-love-26/2026-04-23/
LOCATION:Life Hall 1200
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bound-unbound_1755717910.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair State University Department of Theatre and Dance":MAILTO:grimesl@montclair.edu
END:VEVENT
