X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairlocal": "https://montclairlocal.news/event/mwc-presents-eva-goldfarb-on-the-benefits-of-sex-education-what-the-research-shows-and-whats-at-stake/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:montclairlocal
X-SOURCE:Montclair Local News
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260424T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260424T153000
DTSTAMP:20260423T003530
CREATED:20260421T031919Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260421T031919Z
UID:10139732-1777037400-1777044600@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:MWC Presents: Eva Goldfarb on the Benefits of Sex Education: What the Research Shows and What's at Stake
DESCRIPTION:Across the country\, sex education has become a flashpoint of debate-but what does the evidence actually say? Dr. Eva Goldfarb\, Professor of Public Health at MSU is the lead author of a landmark study demonstrating that comprehensive sex ed does much more than preventing unintended pregnancies and STIs. It improves the health and safety and long-term wellbeing of young people. Dr. Goldfarb will discuss the research as well as the growing efforts to restrict access to this info\, what’s driving those movements and what it means for our community. Open to All. Light Refreshments available after the talk. Free for MWC\, $10 for nonmembers. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/mwc-presents-eva-goldfarb-on-the-benefits-of-sex-education-what-the-research-shows-and-whats-at-stake/
LOCATION:Montclair Women’s Club 82 Union St\, 82 Union St\, Montclair\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sex-education-program-Apr-2026-flyer.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Women's Club":MAILTO:mfeinberg1204@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
