DESCRIPTION:Online Workshop: From Idea to Score: Inside the Creative Process with Composer Quinn Mason\nMonday\, April 27 from 7:00-8:00 p.m.\nFREE Online Workshop | Register HERE \nStep inside a composer’s mind and discover how music comes to life from first idea to finished score. Open to students of all ages and levels\, this FREE session invites you to ask questions\, engage in discussion\, and find inspiration for your own creative work. \nMade possible through the support of The Galanthus Foundation Trust
